---
import { journeyUrl } from '../data/site';
---
<section class="sec xp3d-sec" aria-labelledby="xp3d-title"><div class="wrap">
  <a class="xp3d" href={journeyUrl}>
    <img src="/sites/journey-preview.webp" width="1200" height="675" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Preview of the Portfolio Studio 3D journey: three client sites on floating screens" />
    <span class="xp3d-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">For the curious</span>
      <span class="xp3d-title" id="xp3d-title">Experience Portfolio Studio in 3D</span>
      <span class="xp3d-text">The same story as a camera journey: step inside each client site, watch a CV audit and a site being built. Best on a laptop, and you can switch to a simple view anytime.</span>
      <span class="cta cta-ghost cta-sm">Start the 3D journey ↗</span>
    </span>
  </a>
</div></section>
